[h2]🛠️ Quick Start & Notes[/h2]
[list]
[*]1. When enabling the mod in the game's Mods menu, confirm the network permission prompt, then restart the game.
[*]2. In the pawnshop, press [b]F7[/b] to configure your API endpoint and API Key (DeepSeek's official API is recommended for quality and affordability). Use the test button to verify your connection.
[*]3. [b]Bring Your Own API Key[/b]: The mod connects directly from your local client to your chosen provider; no built-in API quota is included. Your API key is stored locally on your PC.
[*]4. [b]Native Game Rules[/b]: Xiaojing only moves items according to normal game rules. She will not spawn items, auto-complete deals, or alter game balance.
[/list]

